  o Major bugfixes (security):
    - Reject the CC_RESPONSE extension in any handshakes
      for which congestion control was _not_ requested.
      Previously, clients would interpret this extension,
      which could put congestion control into an invalid state,
      leading to a possible remote crash attack.
      Fixes bug 41345; bugfix on 0.4.9.3-alpha.
      Tracked as TROVE-2026-032.
